cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or methodology in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Magistra Predictor: A Dual-Track Framework for GLP-1 Side Effect Estimation"
abstract: "An open, continuously updated system that estimates GLP-1 medication side effect risk by reporting two parallel signals per effect: a clinical incidence estimate and a community reporting frequency, displayed side by side without blending or treating them as comparable quantities. Implements a simplified, unweighted random-effects confidence interval (inspired by DerSimonian-Laird, not inverse-variance weighted), FDR-corrected empirical modifier estimation, and a self-evolving parameter update pipeline with safety guardrails."
